WEBVTT

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:14.380
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:18.970
No matter the era,
there's never enough love.

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:23.980
Now, together let us go on a dazzling
underworld journey of love.

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.740
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:36.780
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.410
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:00.310
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:00.640 --> 00:01:04.230
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:05.060 --> 00:01:08.940
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:12.730
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:12.860 --> 00:01:16.610
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.000
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:25.330 --> 00:01:29.210
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:29.630 --> 00:01:33.090
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:37.970
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:42.100
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:42.220 --> 00:01:45.520
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:49.980
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.360 --> 00:01:54.320
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:58.280
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:03.240
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:10.100
Hey, didn't we come this way before?

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:14.110
We're not lost... are we?

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:16.860
The forest seems kind of...

00:02:23.220 --> 00:02:24.970
What is this?

00:02:25.100 --> 00:02:29.350
W-Well, we'll just have to
ask for directions here.

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.950
It's not a corpse, is it?

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:42.050
Don't say such a scary thing.

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.540
A man?!

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:53.520
Oh my, who interrupted my slumber?

00:02:56.260 --> 00:03:00.840
Keep staring at me
and I might just eat you up.

00:03:05.350 --> 00:03:06.270
CHAPTER 72

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:11.330
IYAMI THE <i>YOKAI</i>'S GREAT LOVE PROJECT

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:16.440
"Kitaro, I made too much of this.

00:03:16.570 --> 00:03:18.090
Care to eat some?"

00:03:27.740 --> 00:03:31.170
That's... a little obtrusive.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.830
"I made too much, so here."

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:37.570
"It'd be a waste to have it go bad..."

00:03:38.510 --> 00:03:39.690
Okay!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:42.700
Yeah. That seems natural.

00:03:44.430 --> 00:03:47.660
So you pour all your seed money into it.
Then...

00:03:48.180 --> 00:03:51.410
-It increases 2... 3... 10... 100 times...
-Kitaro, I made too much, so...

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:58.030
Kitaro went mushroom hunting
with Old Man Crybaby.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:02.880
I'll look over there.

00:04:02.880 --> 00:04:05.910
Leave this area to me.

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:09.040
Ooh! What a harvest!

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.710
Oh! Over here, too!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:14.420
Oh my. A cute little old man.

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.500
Who are you?

00:04:17.500 --> 00:04:19.610
Mushroom hunting is fine, but...

00:04:20.590 --> 00:04:23.320
Let's do something more fun.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.530
More fun?

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.100
Help me out over here, Old Man Crybaby.

00:04:34.350 --> 00:04:37.110
There's a ton.
I can't possibly gather them all myself...

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:41.900
Old Man Crybaby?

00:04:43.860 --> 00:04:44.760
You?!

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.120
What did you do to Old Man Crybaby?!

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:52.000
Don't be so prickly like that.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:54.350
You need more love in your life.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.600
Love?

00:04:57.080 --> 00:04:58.460
What?!

00:05:01.960 --> 00:05:03.550
Yummy...

00:05:07.340 --> 00:05:09.930
Boys need to live romantically.

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:13.390
You really are a good cook.

00:05:13.520 --> 00:05:15.910
You'd make a good wife.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.360
That's nice.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:20.940
I'm back.

00:05:21.070 --> 00:05:22.300
Ah, Kitaro.

00:05:22.820 --> 00:05:28.030
We were all just enjoying
the food that Catchick brought.

00:05:28.160 --> 00:05:29.800
Have some.

00:05:29.800 --> 00:05:31.740
I see...

00:05:39.610 --> 00:05:40.610
Huh?

00:05:41.340 --> 00:05:43.130
If I may ask...

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:49.800
would you cook meals for me
every day from now on?

00:05:51.890 --> 00:05:54.390
K-Kitaro?!

00:05:56.230 --> 00:05:59.630
You are my goddess of love!

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:03.880
If you would reward my feelings for you...

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:09.510
Ah! I would be the happiest soul on Earth!

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.160
U-Um...

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:21.040
This flower wishes to accent your beauty.

00:06:25.420 --> 00:06:27.220
Let's go on a date.

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:31.570
I want you to have something
more fitting than a flower.

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:34.640
With pleasure.

00:07:08.340 --> 00:07:12.010
Did Kitaro really
ask Cat-san out on a date?

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:15.260
Absolutely. We all heard it.

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:17.580
What the heck is going on?

00:07:17.600 --> 00:07:19.940
It's a joyous occasion.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:22.830
At last Kitaro has fallen in love.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:28.420
He's always had the potential as a player.
What a formidable guy!

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.300
He's here!

00:07:38.040 --> 00:07:39.660
Young lady.

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:40.890
Yes?

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:45.810
I knew it at first glance.
You are my destiny.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:55.970
I hope Catchick is doing all right.

00:07:58.180 --> 00:08:03.600
Old Man Crybaby, you didn't go to see
the two of them on their date?

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:06.940
Sand Witch, let me kiss you!

00:08:08.320 --> 00:08:09.550
Yow!

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:11.280
L-Let me kiss you!

00:08:11.400 --> 00:08:13.360
Old Man, are you drunk?!

00:08:13.490 --> 00:08:15.090
I'm not drunk!

00:08:19.910 --> 00:08:21.230
Sand Witch!

00:08:24.580 --> 00:08:27.920
Wally Wall pound!

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:32.170
You're always threatening to kiss me,
aren't you?

00:08:32.300 --> 00:08:33.590
So let me.

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:37.800
M-My first ever
popularity phase has arrived...

00:08:37.930 --> 00:08:39.430
This is upsetting.

00:08:39.560 --> 00:08:43.660
I want to upset you.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:49.940
No!

00:08:50.320 --> 00:08:54.300
I'm not suddenly popular,
something's happened to Old Man Crybaby!

00:08:54.320 --> 00:08:56.240
I have to tell everyone!

00:08:56.820 --> 00:08:59.450
Sand Witch!

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:00.620
Hup.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:06.190
Watch for fire.

00:09:06.210 --> 00:09:11.590
Now, together let us go on a dazzling
underworld journey of love.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:14.030
Huh? Underworld?

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:16.280
Kitaro, why...?

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:17.970
What is Kitaro doing?!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:22.200
I never raised him to be such a flirt!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.830
He really is a player.

00:09:23.850 --> 00:09:27.080
Why can't you all cut him some slack?

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:31.190
Well, I'd take his side
for 100 thousand yen...

00:09:35.740 --> 00:09:36.720
Who's that?!

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.930
Mana! Rat Man! Rollo Cloth!

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.580
I know you're there, Daddy Eyeball!
Where's Sand Witch?!

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.080
Oh my, little lady.

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:52.900
I'm so sorry. Did we startle you?

00:09:54.090 --> 00:09:55.650
Who are you?

00:09:56.550 --> 00:09:58.410
IYAMI

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:00.760
His name is Iyami!

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:04.040
I see! This was all your doing!

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.060
Huh?

00:10:05.680 --> 00:10:07.290
What do you mean?

00:10:07.310 --> 00:10:09.040
A.K.A. Eromodoki.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:14.190
When he breathes on you,
you become intoxicated with love!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:22.390
Then... back then, Kitaro was...

00:10:26.460 --> 00:10:27.770
But...

00:10:28.290 --> 00:10:32.170
There isn't always only one true love.

00:10:32.540 --> 00:10:38.510
No. True love comes to all equally.

00:10:38.630 --> 00:10:42.030
And I am the messenger of love!

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:48.730
You have a magnificent power!
With that power, why don't we do business?

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.440
You can awaken to love, too.

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.840
Your eyes are a million volts.

00:11:00.860 --> 00:11:01.990
What?

00:11:02.120 --> 00:11:04.280
More than a million volts,
a hundred-yen coin!

00:11:04.410 --> 00:11:06.290
It's cheap but worth a can of juice.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.870
Would you go on a date with me?

00:11:09.290 --> 00:11:11.460
Back off, Rat Man!

00:11:11.580 --> 00:11:14.020
What?! You back off!

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:16.690
I need in on the action!

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.170
Keep away, you freak!

00:11:19.300 --> 00:11:21.070
Why? How come?

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:24.300
Ladies! Who's up for a dry rubdown?

00:11:24.430 --> 00:11:25.700
A talking towel?!

00:11:29.660 --> 00:11:30.770
Mana!

00:11:30.890 --> 00:11:34.730
Sand Witch-san!
That <i>yokai</i> did this to everyone!

00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.420
Sand Witch, it's Iyami!

00:11:36.440 --> 00:11:40.840
I get it! He's the reason
Old Man Crybaby was acting strange!

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.490
A present for you.

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:53.040
Wally Wall-san! Are you okay?!

00:11:54.840 --> 00:11:58.400
Want to spin the thread of love with me?

00:11:59.550 --> 00:12:00.900
No thanks...

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:03.640
Now if you'll excuse me.

00:12:04.680 --> 00:12:06.410
Honey.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:09.410
Ah, my goddess of love!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:11.910
You came for me.

00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:15.420
Now let us escape together.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:27.780
Mana, take care of this!

00:12:27.950 --> 00:12:29.010
What?!

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:31.910
Mana-chan, let's retreat for now!

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:32.750
Right!

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:35.650
Don't be shy, my sweet honey.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:39.650
CATCHICK

00:12:40.380 --> 00:12:44.150
<i>YOKAI</i> IYAMI

00:12:42.170 --> 00:12:43.050
-<i>"No, no."</i>
-<i>"Oh, what should I do?"</i>

00:12:43.180 --> 00:12:44.050
<i>"Look me in the eye and tell me."</i>

00:12:59.530 --> 00:13:01.280
Do you want ramen or Chinese?

00:13:01.400 --> 00:13:04.360
They're both Chinese. I want Italian.

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.340
Then let's go there.

00:13:22.090 --> 00:13:25.970
I know this is hard for you.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:30.310
I know Kitaro was acting strange.

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:35.330
It makes sense that he was
under Iyami's spell.

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:38.020
But, when he gave me that flower,

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:42.340
he might not have been
under the spell yet...

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:48.740
I was in love with a man once.

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:54.350
Would you like to hear what happened?

00:13:57.920 --> 00:14:02.550
I could never ask him how he felt,
and now...

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:04.720
You know.

00:14:05.090 --> 00:14:09.550
I was still young,
and I thought if he refused me

00:14:09.680 --> 00:14:13.080
I wouldn't be able to go on.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:18.270
And now, my memories remain ever pure.

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:21.860
Perhaps that was enough for me.

00:14:21.980 --> 00:14:22.960
But...

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:39.630
You're right.

00:14:40.540 --> 00:14:41.880
That's right!

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:46.400
We managed to get away from
Wally Wall-san, but...

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.410
Where's... Kitaro?

00:14:49.430 --> 00:14:53.060
Wandering off chasing women...
How shameful!

00:14:53.180 --> 00:14:56.790
We have to find Kitaro
and purify his soul!

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.060
I'm sor...

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:00.810
Iyami!

00:15:00.940 --> 00:15:03.000
Oh my. Hello there.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:08.260
You turned Kitaro into that
sad little simpleton! Undo your spell now!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:11.410
No matter the era,
there's never enough love.

00:15:11.530 --> 00:15:16.390
Now that I'm awake,
I have to spread as much love as I can.

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:19.790
What are you talking about?!
Turn everyone back!

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:21.150
I refuse.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:24.420
You can awaken to love, too.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:33.180
To undo my spell,
you'll have to defeat me.

00:15:33.300 --> 00:15:37.120
But that won't be happening.

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.370
You're my muse!

00:15:40.520 --> 00:15:42.000
Marry me!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.250
Please let me kiss her!

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:57.200
Oh my.
If it isn't Miss Trouble in Paradise.

00:15:57.330 --> 00:15:59.060
Don't scowl like that.

00:15:59.080 --> 00:16:04.150
Sorry, but what you've done has
pissed me off.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:07.210
Do you need a little love, too?

00:16:17.430 --> 00:16:20.520
Wh-Wh-What a horrible little girl!

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.000
You think you can escape me?!

00:16:31.110 --> 00:16:33.760
Help me, warriors of love!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.990
Such a cute little girl is all alone.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:40.000
Are you all going to just stand around?

00:16:40.120 --> 00:16:43.370
My most beautiful goddess in the world.

00:16:43.500 --> 00:16:45.900
As promised, let's go on our d--

00:16:48.500 --> 00:16:50.320
Pretty girl!

00:16:51.010 --> 00:16:55.300
This girl is going to take
a <i>sake</i> bath with me!

00:16:55.800 --> 00:16:57.600
Whoa, whoa, give me a break.

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:01.370
Can't you see
she obviously belongs with me?

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:04.140
The mouth says "no",
but the heart says "yes".

00:17:04.270 --> 00:17:07.710
I've always known
your feelings of love for m--

00:17:08.230 --> 00:17:10.840
You, back off.

00:17:10.860 --> 00:17:14.660
How come...? Why only me?

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:16.780
Hey!

00:17:16.910 --> 00:17:17.910
Stop right there!

00:17:18.030 --> 00:17:18.930
Mana!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:23.120
Cat-san's lips belong to me alone!

00:17:24.960 --> 00:17:28.480
I'm gonna live with Mana-chan.

00:17:28.500 --> 00:17:30.320
Cat-san!

00:17:34.970 --> 00:17:36.800
Kiss...

00:17:38.220 --> 00:17:39.700
Iyami!

00:17:44.140 --> 00:17:46.400
There's no escape.

00:17:46.520 --> 00:17:48.170
Give it up!

00:17:58.070 --> 00:17:59.620
Very well...

00:18:00.530 --> 00:18:04.620
You want to play? Let's play!

00:18:14.840 --> 00:18:17.740
Love always wins!

00:18:23.720 --> 00:18:28.270
It looks like your love and mine
are a little different.

00:18:28.810 --> 00:18:30.940
Wait, Catchick!

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:32.840
I've found you.

00:18:33.110 --> 00:18:35.840
Why did you leave me behind?

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:37.950
You lack love!

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:48.040
You know how I feel, don't you?

00:18:50.670 --> 00:18:52.110
I love you.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:57.260
You're all I need.
Let's go to a world all our own.

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:01.490
Go ahead and reciprocate.

00:19:01.510 --> 00:19:08.250
Defeat me and the spell breaks,
and he might never say those words again.

00:19:08.270 --> 00:19:10.370
Are you really fine with that?

00:19:10.400 --> 00:19:14.250
Don't you want this kid to love you
and be happy?

00:19:15.860 --> 00:19:21.030
You're always so dense
and you never say anything considerate.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:24.490
Much less ever give me a present.

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:31.270
So, receiving that flower
really made me happy.

00:19:31.290 --> 00:19:32.270
Then...!

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.750
But...

00:19:36.800 --> 00:19:41.010
And now, my memories remain ever pure.

00:19:41.130 --> 00:19:44.300
Perhaps that was enough for me.

00:19:44.430 --> 00:19:47.180
But you're stronger than me.

00:19:47.310 --> 00:19:49.040
And greedier.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:54.150
Unless you receive Kitaro's true,
unhypnotized feelings,

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:56.670
you'll never be satisfied, will you?

00:19:59.240 --> 00:20:00.740
You're right.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.200
That's right!

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:05.350
I'm so very greedy.

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:09.730
Receiving such fake feelings
is hardly enough!

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.480
I can't be satisfied!

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:18.230
One day, through my own merit,
I'll receive Kitaro's real feelings!

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:21.280
Whoa! H-Hold on! Wait!

00:20:21.300 --> 00:20:23.070
Otherwise,

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:26.510
there's no point!

00:20:28.310 --> 00:20:32.190
That's... a man's...

00:20:39.610 --> 00:20:40.940
Kitaro!

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:48.450
Where am I?

00:20:48.580 --> 00:20:50.100
I hurt all over...

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:52.620
What happened?

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:53.960
Mana!

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.350
Sand Witch-san!

00:21:05.760 --> 00:21:06.970
Are you awake?

00:21:07.100 --> 00:21:08.930
What was I...?

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:11.310
Who knows? Maybe you were dreaming.

00:21:14.850 --> 00:21:16.230
Catchick.

00:21:22.990 --> 00:21:24.720
Thank you.

00:21:30.740 --> 00:21:32.660
Cat-san!

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:35.230
C'mon, let me go!

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:40.880
I was under Iyami's spell!
I wasn't hittin' on girls on purpose!

00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:42.110
Stop lying!

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:47.010
You weren't under his spell,
you lecherous loincloth! I'll kiss you!

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:48.600
Kiss me?

00:21:49.470 --> 00:21:51.770
Oh man, I'm hungry.

00:21:51.890 --> 00:21:55.600
You've got time, right?
Come join me for some ramen.

00:21:56.440 --> 00:21:58.310
Sure. I'll go.

